# The private dataset — the family archive and its derived projection. Real
# family content lives on the big disk (scans/Loft/archive, the tools/loft_paths.py
# seam), never in the public repo. The archive-quality evals run locally (data
# present) and skip in CI (the checkout has no archive) — see docs/testing-standards.md.
archive/
app/data/
demo/  # the demo archive + projection, generated by loft create-demo

